s and strengths of each of his students, assigns special training exercises to Lecty and Misora. The two girls prepare for the toughest challenge, but get something beyond their expectations.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-07-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pPg2ePgBEFeYPxyKdiDrX52wNLD.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pPg2ePgBEFeYPxyKdiDrX52wNLD.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67553/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1216936","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"It's obvious that Misora has no chance of success with her current weapon, the Magic Cannon Sword. However, she is not willing to use a weapon more suited to her talents. Kanata must find out why.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-07-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/muI3ejggdRDjeCvXv7po3Apxs11.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/muI3ejggdRDjeCvXv7po3Apxs11.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67553/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1216937","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kanata is able to train Misora and Lecty to realize their strengths and weaknesses, bringing up their combat readiness. However, as a team, they are still incomplete - until Kanata convinces Rico to join, Fireteam E601 is a doomed as ever.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-08-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r6TfAjL8ac8FOu47TLGNRLTKCi1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r6TfAjL8ac8FOu47TLGNRLTKCi1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/67553/season/1/episode/5"}